# The repo-root .gitignore excludes all USD files; the robot assets under
# assets/robots/ and the example scenes under scenes/ are deliberately
# vendored (see README.md), so re-include them.
!assets/**/*.usd
!assets/**/*.usda
!scenes/**/*.usd
!scenes/**/*.usda
# The vendored scenegen tree mirrors the GCS layout, which contains "runs/"
# directories; the repo-root "**/runs/*" rule would exclude those parent dirs
# (making the file re-includes above dead letters), so un-ignore the tree.
!scenes/**/runs/**
